data: {"text": "[[28]]", "reference": {"citation_key": 28, "reference_text": "Shah MV, Arber DA, Hiwase DK. <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/ajh.27655\">TP53 -Mutated Myeloid Neoplasms: 2024 Update On\u00a0Diagnosis, Risk-Stratification, and Management</a>. American Journal of Hematology. 2025;100 Suppl 4:88-115. doi:10.1002/ajh.27655.", "reference_detail": {"title": "TP53\u2010Mutated Myeloid Neoplasms: 2024 Update on Diagnosis, Risk\u2010Stratification, and Management", "authors_string": "Shah MV, Arber DA, Hiwase DK.", "publication_info_string": "American Journal of Hematology. 2025;100 Suppl 4:88-115. doi:10.1002/ajh.27655.", "journal_name": "American Journal of Hematology", "journal_short_name": "Am J Hematol", "publication_date": "2025-06-01", "doi": "10.1002/ajh.27655", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1002/ajh.27655"}, "source_texts": []}}

data: {"text": "\nIn CLL, the NCCN prognostic-variable table explicitly lists TP53 mutation (with or without del"}

data: {"text": "17p]) as conferring shorter PFS/OS and increased resistance to both chemoimmunotherapy and targeted agents, and notes low-burden variants (<10% VAF) may behave like wild type."}

data: {"text": "[[22]]", "reference": {"citation_key": 22, "reference_text": "National Comprehensive Cancer Network. Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia/Small Lymphocytic Lymphoma.", "reference_detail": {"title": "Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia/Small Lymphocytic Lymphoma", "authors_string": "National Comprehensive Cancer Network", "publication_info_string": "Updated 2026-09-28", "publication_date": "2026-09-28", "url": "https://www.nccn.org/professionals/physician_gls/pdf/cll.pdf#page=17"}, "source_texts": []}}

data: {"text": " In TP53-mutant AML/MDS, allogeneic HCT remains the only pot"}

data: {"text": "entially curative option, though outcomes remain poor (2-year OS ~19%)."}

data: {"text": "[[28]]", "reference": {"citation_key": 28, "reference_text": "Shah MV, Arber DA, Hiwase DK. <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/ajh.27655\">TP53 -Mutated Myeloid Neoplasms: 2024 Update On\u00a0Diagnosis, Risk-Stratification, and Management</a>. American Journal of Hematology. 2025;100 Suppl 4:88-115. doi:10.1002/ajh.27655.", "reference_detail": {"title": "TP53\u2010Mutated Myeloid Neoplasms: 2024 Update on Diagnosis, Risk\u2010Stratification, and Management", "authors_string": "Shah MV, Arber DA, Hiwase DK.", "publication_info_string": "American Journal of Hematology. 2025;100 Suppl 4:88-115. doi:10.1002/ajh.27655.", "journal_name": "American Journal of Hematology", "journal_short_name": "Am J Hematol", "publication_date": "2025-06-01", "doi": "10.1002/ajh.27655", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1002/ajh.27655"}, "source_texts": []}}

