data: {"text": "[[30]]", "reference": {"citation_key": 30, "reference_text": "Reuss M, Meyer T, Ingelfinger F, et al. <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41409-026-03029-2\">Characterisation of TP53 Mutational Features and Outcomes of Acute Myeloid Leukaemia After Allogeneic Haematopoietic Cell Transplantation</a>. Bone Marrow Transplantation. 2026;:10.1038/s41409-026-03029-2. doi:10.1038/s41409-026-03029-2.", "reference_detail": {"title": "Characterisation of TP53 mutational features and outcomes of acute myeloid leukaemia after allogeneic haematopoietic cell transplantation", "authors_string": "Reuss M, Meyer T, Ingelfinger F, et al.", "publication_info_string": "Bone Marrow Transplantation. 2026;:10.1038/s41409-026-03029-2. doi:10.1038/s41409-026-03029-2.", "journal_name": "Bone Marrow Transplantation", "journal_short_name": "Bone Marrow Transplant", "publication_date": "2026-09-04", "doi": "10.1038/s41409-026-03029-2", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41409-026-03029-2"}, "source_texts": []}}

data: {"text": "\n"}

data: {"text": "Important caveats."}

data: {"text": " Outside the Y220C-selective rezatapopt data, clinical translation of p53-targeted therapy has been largely disappointing, reflecting the biologic heterogeneity of TP53 mutations (missense vs nonsense, structural vs cont"}

data: {"text": "act, allelic burden, co-mutations such as KRAS)."}

